{"name":"Roseville","hex":"#b495b0","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"Roseville","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Proper noun","definitions":["A number of places in the United States:\nA city in Placer County, California.\n\nA village in Warren County, Illinois.\nA census-designated place in Ulster Township and Union Township, Floyd County, Iowa.\nA city in Macomb County, Michigan.\nA city in Ramsey County, Minnesota.\nTwo townships in Minnesota, in Grant County and Kandiyohi County.\nA neighbourhood of Newark, Essex County, New Jersey.\nA village in Muskingum County and Perry County, Ohio.\nAn unincorporated community in Jefferson County, Pennsylvania.\nA borough in Tioga County, Pennsylvania, named after Dr. William Rose.\nAn unincorporated community in Stafford County, Virginia.","A city in Placer County, California."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/Roseville"}],"entries":[{"title":"Roseville, New South Wales","blocks":[{"text":"Roseville is a suburb on the North Shore of Sydney in the state of New South Wales, Australia 12 kilometres (7.5 mi) north-west of the Sydney central business district, in the local government areas of Ku-ring-gai and Willoughby. Roseville Chase is a separate suburb to the east."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c1/Hill_Street%2C_Roseville_on_6_June_2025_%28cropped%29.jpg/330px-Hill_Street%2C_Roseville_on_6_June_2025_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Roseville%2C_New_South_Wales","wikidata":"Q12067575"},{"title":"Roseville, Ontario","blocks":[{"text":"Roseville is a community in Ontario, Canada located at 43°20′35″N 80°28′31″W. It is within the rural township of North Dumfries, which forms part of the Region of Waterloo, and is located between Ayr, Kitchener and Highway 401."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/3f/Roseville_Town_Sign.jpg/330px-Roseville_Town_Sign.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Roseville%2C_Ontario","wikidata":"Q7368718"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e3/SLNSW_796810_Bancroft_Ave_Roseville.jpg/500px-SLNSW_796810_Bancroft_Ave_Roseville.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e3/SLNSW_796810_Bancroft_Ave_Roseville.jpg/1280px-SLNSW_796810_Bancroft_Ave_Roseville.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e3/SLNSW_796810_Bancroft_Ave_Roseville.jpg/500px-SLNSW_796810_Bancroft_Ave_Roseville.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Bancroft Avenue, Roseville, as it appeared in a postcard taken in the period 1900–1927.","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ASLNSW_796810_Bancroft_Ave_Roseville.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/ee/17_The_Grove%2C_Roseville%2C_New_South_Wales_%282011-04-28%29.jpg/120px-17_The_Grove%2C_Roseville%2C_New_South_Wales_%282011-04-28%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/ee/17_The_Grove%2C_Roseville%2C_New_South_Wales_%282011-04-28%29.jpg/250px-17_The_Grove%2C_Roseville%2C_New_South_Wales_%282011-04-28%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/ee/17_The_Grove%2C_Roseville%2C_New_South_Wales_%282011-04-28%29.jpg/120px-17_The_Grove%2C_Roseville%2C_New_South_Wales_%282011-04-28%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3A17_The_Grove%2C_Roseville%2C_New_South_Wales_(2011-04-28).jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/w